{
 "about": "Photorealism catalogue for the WAEC Geography lab. 'bundled' files are already in this folder. 'fetch' entries are exact asset IDs to download with tools/fetch_geo_assets.py (Poly Haven: polyhaven.com/a/<id>; ambientCG: ambientcg.com/view?id=<id>). 'photos' are reference/real-photo searches to collect with the same script (Wikimedia Commons API, licence-filtered) or by hand from public-domain agencies. All Poly Haven and ambientCG assets are CC0.",
